  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong><br>JordiLight illuminates the path for adventurers and professionals alike, merging cutting-edge technology with eco-friendly solutions to brighten every experience. Our commitment to innovation, quality, and sustainability positions us as a beacon in the lighting industry, catering to those who dare to explore and those who strive for excellence in their work.</p><p><strong>Product Description:</strong><br>JordiLight offers a revolutionary adventure utility flashlight designed for versatility across any setting. From rugged terrains to professional environments, our product boasts 3600 lumens of pure white and 256 color lighting options, a 180° beam, and features like magnetic clips, Bluetooth connectivity, emergency fall sensor, built in compass, and app customization. Whether it's for scaling mountains or lighting up workspaces, JordiLight is your go-to light companion.</p><p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>The standout feature of JordiLight is its unparalleled versatility, combining a headlamp, flashlight, and lantern in one compact device. With its superior power output, customizable lighting, and sustainable design, JordiLight transcends traditional lighting solutions, offering a premium, adaptable experience for adventurers and professionals.</p><p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><br>JordiLight accepts payments through major credit cards. We offer flexible payment options, including installment plans for qualifying customers. Our aim is to make our innovative lighting solutions accessible to all, ensuring secure and convenient transactions.</p><p><strong>Other Information:</strong><br>JordiLight is committed to sustainability, utilizing eco-friendly materials and production processes. We offer a 1-year warranty, and dedicated customer support. Stay tuned for our upcoming products and features by following us on our social media channels and subscribing to our newsletter.</p></div>",
